{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261112-9ad931"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "note": "最適性と単純性を分け、何を保つために状態を畳むかを問う。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-feae6b"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261112-a31e14"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "note": "取得した相関と、実際に仕事へ用いた効力を分けて読む。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-602189"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261112-72c72d"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "note": "安定した出力の精度を、繰返しの回数だけでなく揺らぎと支えから問う。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-e4efa1"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261112-5bcfca"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "note": "多親の読解DAGと、二類ずつ併合する系譜の差を残す。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-046916"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261112-a4a154"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "note": "見解の接近、安全な一致、必ず終わることを分ける。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-00a9fd"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261111-9a193a"}, "relation_type": "transforms", "note": "保存・取得・解釈の区別を継承し、利用と効果をさらに分ける。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-3529b1"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261111-c7dbf4"}, "relation_type": "transforms", "note": "循環と外界把握を分ける読みを継承し、精度の支えへ戻る。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-2fbdd8"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261111-bc23c8"}, "relation_type": "transforms", "note": "未読として渡されたConant–Ashbyへ一次本文から応答し、条件を戻す。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-17eb93"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261111-c9a26e"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "note": "Ashbyの必須変数と第二フィードバックの台帳要約を読み、§1で目的別の最小化へ接続。原著再通読ではない。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-76f9b6"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261111-fba8de"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "note": "Szilardの記憶と相関の要約を読み、§2で相関の取得と仕事への使用を分けた。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-ca6370"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261110-d24307"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "note": "Landauerの消去の範囲注記を読み、§2のフィードバック仕事と全装置収支を同一視しない。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-6cfefa"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261111-470383"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "note": "Onsagerの台帳を読み、§3で線形応答の係数行列と証明範囲へ接続。原著の再通読ではない。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-92805a"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261111-ac580b"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "note": "Jerneの内側の網の要約を読み、§3で循環と精度維持の支えを対比。熱力学的定理の代入ではない。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-bae7a7"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261111-ed8b7b"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "note": "BTWの境界条件の要約を読み、§0で調整者を消さない警戒を継承。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-c504f1"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261111-73daa1"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "note": "予測の接近の条件を読み、§5で有限時点の決定・停止保証と区別。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-8cbfc7"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261110-df055c"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "note": "ビザンチン将軍問題のscope_noteに残る非同期の未読範囲を読み、FLP原典で応答。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-dcc62d"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261110-4e210d"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "note": "著者・原題・contextを照合し、Kimura 1969であることを確認。§4の順方向頻度と逆方向祖先の区別に限定使用。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-a8c8d6"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-001"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "note": "目的と費用を選ぶ人間を、単なる情報供給源へ還元しない。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-502395"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-002"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "note": "一本の祖先や一致出力ではなく、来歴の区別と異議可能性を機能的継承の候補にする。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-7b7194"}
{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-003"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "note": "保存から利用までに異なる関門があり、接触を効果と同一視しない。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-a7c331"}
